# Optional: cloud connect source builds
# Iskra ships no hosted Clerk, relay, or app deployment, so cloud features stay
# disabled until you fill these in for infrastructure you operate. These are
# public identifiers, not secrets. Do not add server-side secrets to this file.

# Your Clerk instance, from the Clerk Dashboard under API keys, JWT templates,
# and OAuth applications.
# ISKRA_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# ISKRA_CLERK_JWT_TEMPLATE=
# ISKRA_CLERK_CLI_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=

# Optional: signed macOS passkey builds. The RP domain defaults to the Frontend API
# hostname encoded in ISKRA_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY. Set the override only when Clerk
# returns a different RP ID or when multiple domains must be entitled.
# ISKRA_APPLE_TEAM_ID=ABC1234567
# ISKRA_MACOS_PROVISIONING_PROFILE=/absolute/path/to/iskra.provisionprofile
# ISKRA_CLERK_PASSKEY_RP_DOMAINS=example.clerk.accounts.dev,clerk.example.com

# Your relay origin. For a self-hosted relay, `infra/relay` deploys update it
# automatically.
# ISKRA_RELAY_URL=

# Optional: hosted app origin used by the CLI's out-of-band OAuth flow. No default.
# ISKRA_HOSTED_APP_URL=

# Public, ingest-only mobile OpenTelemetry configuration.
# ISKRA_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_URL=https://api.axiom.co/v1/traces
# ISKRA_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_DATASET=iskra-mobile-traces-dev
# ISKRA_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_TOKEN=xaat-...
